<header><a class="brand" id="home-link" href="../homesamplepage/index.html"><span class="mark">CCS</span><span class="wordmark">CCS SOLUTIONS<small>PRECISION IN MOTION</small></span></a><nav class="nav"><a id="website-link" href="../homesamplepage/index.html">BACK TO WEBSITE ↗</a><span>CUSTOMER CARE</span><button class="outline" id="logout" hidden>Sign out ↗</button></nav></header>
<div class="env" id="environment-label">DESIGN PREVIEW · SAMPLE DATA ONLY · No messages are sent</div>
<main id="public-view"><section class="hero"><div class="copy"><div class="eyebrow">A closer connection to your car</div><h1>YOUR VEHICLE.<br>EVERY <em>DETAIL.</em></h1><p class="lead">Your service journey, in one place.<br>ඔබේ වාහනයේ Repair status, Warranty සහ Bills ආරක්ෂිතව බලන්න.</p><div class="trust"><span>PRIVATE ACCESS</span><span>WHATSAPP VERIFIED</span><span>ALWAYS CONNECTED</span></div></div>
<section class="auth-card" aria-labelledby="form-title"><div class="steps"><b id="step-one">01 / YOUR VEHICLE</b><span id="step-two">02 / VERIFY</span><span>03 / RECORDS</span></div>
<form id="plate-form"><h2 id="form-title">Find your vehicle.</h2><p class="support">Vehicle number එක ඇතුළත් කරන්න. Verification code එක ඔබේ saved WhatsApp number එකට යවයි.</p><label for="plate">VEHICLE REGISTRATION / වාහන අංකය</label><input class="field" id="plate" name="plate" placeholder="WP CAA–4821" maxlength="30" required autocomplete="off"><button class="primary" type="submit"><span>Send WhatsApp code</span><span>↗</span></button></form>
<form id="otp-form" hidden><h2>Check your WhatsApp.</h2><p class="support">Saved WhatsApp number එකට ලැබුණු අංක 6ක code එක ඇතුළත් කරන්න. Code එක විනාඩි 5කින් අවසන් වේ.</p><label for="otp">VERIFICATION CODE / තහවුරු කිරීමේ අංකය</label><input class="field" id="otp" name="code" placeholder="000000" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{6}" maxlength="6" autocomplete="one-time-code" required><button class="primary" type="submit"><span>Verify & view my records</span><span>↗</span></button><div class="row"><button class="link-button" type="button" id="change-plate">Change vehicle</button><button class="link-button" type="button" id="resend">Resend code</button></div><p class="micro" id="demo-code" hidden>DESIGN DEMO ONLY: enter 123456. This does not verify a real account.</p></form>
<p class="notice" id="form-notice" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="lock"><svg width="17" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="10" width="16" height="12" rx="2" stroke="currentColor"/><path d="M5 10V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v3" stroke="currentColor"/></svg><span class="micro" style="margin:0">Vehicle number එක පමණක් දමා private details බලන්න බැහැ. ඔබගේ WhatsApp code එක වෙනත් අයෙකුට දෙන්න එපා.</span></div></section></section>
<section class="features"><article class="feature"><small>01 / FOLLOW THE JOURNEY</small><h3>Repair progress, clearly.</h3><p>Vehicle received සිට collection දක්වා ඔබේ service status එක බලන්න.</p></article><article class="feature"><small>02 / KNOW YOUR COVER</small><h3>Every warranty. Together.</h3><p>Part serial, warranty dates සහ approved conditions එකම තැනක.</p></article><article class="feature"><small>03 / KEEP IT SIMPLE</small><h3>Your bills, without the guesswork.</h3><p>Total, received payments සහ remaining balance පැහැදිලිව බලන්න.</p></article></section></main>
<main class="portal" id="portal-view" hidden><div class="portal-title"><div><div class="eyebrow">YOUR CCS GARAGE</div><h1 id="greeting">Welcome back.</h1><p id="customer-code"></p></div><div><button class="outline" id="print-summary">Print / Save summary ↗</button><p class="expiry">Private session · expires after 15 minutes</p></div></div><p class="portal-alert" id="portal-alert" hidden></p><div class="workspace"><aside><p class="side-label">YOUR VEHICLES</p><div class="vehicles" id="vehicle-list"></div><p class="micro">Choose a vehicle to see its records.<br>ඔබේ වාහනය තෝරන්න.</p></aside><section><div class="panel" id="repair-panel"></div><div class="two-col"><div><section class="panel"><h2>Warranty cards <span style="color:var(--gold)">↗</span></h2><div id="warranty-list"></div><p class="small-note">Warranty dates are guidance. Claims depend on approved conditions and inspection.</p></section><section class="panel"><h2>Your part serials</h2><div id="serial-list"></div></section></div><div><section class="panel"><h2>Invoices & payments</h2><div id="invoice-list"></div></section><section class="panel"><h2>WhatsApp updates</h2><div id="activity-list"></div><p class="small-note">Accepted = Meta accepted the request. This does not confirm delivery/read.</p></section></div></div></section></div></main>
<footer><span>© CCS SOLUTIONS · CUSTOMER CARE</span><span>YOUR CAR. YOUR RECORDS. YOUR PEACE OF MIND.</span></footer>
